  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>歡迎來到櫻花 Mod，一個融合竹子、WA 與楓樹的模組。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/XmQ8N1SBjJKhFy6.png\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">這個模組充滿了日式風格，定食、壽司，還有各式各樣的美食。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">使用你的武士刀和小太刀進行全新的戰鬥風格，利用營火和烹飪鍋來料理食物。</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">新的掠奪者手持武士刀，在竹林和楓林中出沒！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">新的服裝：和服、浴衣和羽織。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">請盡情享受～</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>官方宣傳影片：</strong></h4><p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eaTCFOl_YyQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">遊戲截圖：</span></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/aoQGLIkAwTb5z9s.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1519\" height=\"792\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/g8k9wzsUV7ZBpAn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1114\" height=\"580\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/7N4ioG1OHFQwtb2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/i8OR6hEB2IXyDHA.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Syameimaru 的 Patreon 連結：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/syameimaru_zheng\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/syameimaru_zheng</a></p>",
